data: {"id": "51babd4888dd49f0-thinking-layer-189", "run_id": "51babd4888dd49f0", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `workload` 的 `kubectl get` 输出确认了其状态为 `Running` 但 `READY` 为 `0/1`。这通常意味着容器正在运行，但 `readiness` 探针失败，或者容器尚未完全准备好接受流量。\n\n为了进一步确认异常类型，我将检查该 Pod 的 `describe` 输出，特别是关注事件（Events）和探针状态。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789387733776}

