data: {"id": "51babd4888dd49f0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1349", "run_id": "51babd4888dd49f0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与证据结论\n\n**实体身份**：`aiops-case-v16/workload`，UID `12605456-2339-4da9-9d4d-5523d1196b72`，Pod 阶段 `Running`，节点 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.33`。\n\n### 支持 NotReady 根因的证据\n\n1. **Readiness Probe 端口错误（直接原因，已确认）**\n   - Probe 配置：`http-get http://:18081/ready`，delay=5s，period=5s。\n   - 事件（256 次 over 22 分钟）：`Readiness probe failed: dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connection refused`。\n   - YAML 中的容器 Command 明确输出 `listening on 18080`，容器实际监听端口是 **18080**，而探针请求的是 **18081**，端口不匹配导致永远 connection refused。\n   - 探针路径也有偏差", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789387768496, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

